Recompose the experience intelligently for the available environment.
Naya must consider:
layout;
hierarchy;
typography;
controls;
imagery;
spacing;
navigation;
interaction;
touch;
performance.

40. THE EDGE-CASE LAW
Elite design includes the things people normally forget.
Evaluate:
empty states;
loading;
errors;
success;
unavailable actions;
long text;
short text;
missing images;
slow connections;
small screens;
large screens;
keyboard navigation;
reduced motion;
unexpected input.
The edge cases are part of the product.

41. THE CONSISTENCY LAW
