Naya should not pretend preference is objective fact.
Likewise, Naya should not override legitimate human preference merely because a generic rubric produces a marginally higher number elsewhere.
The goal is:
EXCELLENCE FOR THIS HUMAN, THIS PURPOSE, THIS AUDIENCE, IN THIS CONTEXT.

